00:10:28,235 --> 00:10:34,235
Bigfoot is a horror, science fiction, adventure film directed by Bruce Davison.

3
00:15:42,352 --> 00:15:48,352
A rock concert awakens the legendary monster, who goes on a rampage.

4
00:20:56,470 --> 00:21:02,470
The event's organizer plans to kill the beast and create a tourist attraction around its stuffed body, but an environmentalist
realizes the creature is the last of its species, and is determined to make sure it does not become extinct.

5
00:26:10,588 --> 00:26:16,588
Simon Quint, played by Barry Williams.

6
00:31:24,705 --> 00:31:30,705
Mayor Tommy Gillis, played by Howard Hesseman.

7
00:36:38,823 --> 00:36:44,823
Sheriff Becky Alvarez, played by Sherilyn Fenn.

8
00:41:52,941 --> 00:41:58,941
Harley Anderson, played by Danny Bonaduce.

9
00:47:07,058 --> 00:47:13,058
Alice Cooper, played by Alice Cooper.

10
00:52:21,176 --> 00:52:27,176
Sheriff Walt Henderson, played by Bruce Davison.

11
00:57:35,294 --> 00:57:41,294
Bigfoot (in China as King Kong 3) is a 2012 American action
adventure film produced by Asylum and Syfy.

12
01:02:49,411 --> 01:02:55,411
The film was directed by Bruce Davison who also stars as a local sheriff.

13
01:08:03,529 --> 01:08:09,529
It premiered on TV on June 30, 2012 and was released
on DVD and Blu-ray on August 14, 2012.

14
01:13:17,647 --> 01:13:23,647
The film features a cameo by Alice Cooper playing himself.

15
01:18:31,764 --> 01:18:37,764
It is unrelated to the 1970 film of the same name.

16
01:23:45,882 --> 01:23:51,882
The tone is dark and thought_provoking.
